  "solution": "**Logic:** Second no. = [(First no.) × 8 + 3]\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n1. (24, 195) →\n\n⇒ [(24 × 8) + 3]\n\n⇒ (192 + 3) = 195\n\n2. (26, 211) →\n\n⇒ [(26 × 8) + 3]\n\n⇒ (208 + 3) = 211\n\n**3. (25, 200) →**\n\n**⇒ [(25 × 8) + 0]**\n\n**⇒ (200 + 0) = 200**\n\n4. (36, 291) →\n\n⇒ [(36 × 8) + 3]\n\n⇒ (288 + 3) = 291\n\nHere, in **(25, 200) **different logic is followed.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".",
